WEBVTT

00:00:05.192 --> 00:00:06.392
(TIRES SCREECHING)

00:00:08.072 --> 00:00:10.272
Hello, fellow racers!

00:00:10.632 --> 00:00:13.352
It's that little crumb snatcher.

00:00:13.512 --> 00:00:16.152
Candlehead, Taffyta, Rancis,
you're looking well.

00:00:16.272 --> 00:00:18.792
Came by to check out
the competition, huh?

00:00:18.952 --> 00:00:21.792
Well, here it is, the Lickety-Split!

00:00:22.032 --> 00:00:23.992
Sheesh. Looks like she built it herself.

00:00:24.232 --> 00:00:25.352
I built it myself.

00:00:25.512 --> 00:00:28.032
Fastest pedal-power
west of the Whac-A-Mole.

00:00:28.152 --> 00:00:29.272
Check her out.

00:00:30.912 --> 00:00:32.072
(HONKING)

00:00:33.872 --> 00:00:37.992
Oh, Vanellope, it's so... You.

00:00:38.072 --> 00:00:39.072
(CHUCKLING SMUGLY)

00:00:39.152 --> 00:00:42.072
But you have to
back out of the race. Yeah.

00:00:42.192 --> 00:00:43.752
Oh, no, I don't,

00:00:43.872 --> 00:00:46.592
because I paid my fee
and I'm on the board...

00:00:46.792 --> 00:00:48.912
So, yeah, I'm definitely racing.

00:00:49.152 --> 00:00:51.912
Yeah, well, King Candy says
glitches can't race.

00:00:52.032 --> 00:00:55.432
I'm not a glitch, Taffyta.
I've just got pixslexia, okay?

00:00:55.632 --> 00:00:57.512
The rules are there
for a reason, Vanellope.

00:00:57.672 --> 00:01:00.472
To protect us. Say I'm you.

00:01:00.632 --> 00:01:03.272
I'm in my weird little car and I'm driving

00:01:03.432 --> 00:01:05.952
and I actually feel kind of cool for once.

00:01:06.112 --> 00:01:08.072
And then, all of a sudden, oh, no.

00:01:08.272 --> 00:01:10.632
I'm (STAMMERING) glitching!

00:01:10.792 --> 00:01:12.072
-(GASPS) Hey!
-See?

00:01:12.192 --> 00:01:14.272
You're an accident
just waiting to happen.

00:01:14.352 --> 00:01:17.312
Oh, no! I (STAMMERS) glitched, too!

00:01:18.512 --> 00:01:19.712
Uncool.

00:01:19.912 --> 00:01:22.552
Stop it! Stop! You're breaking it!

00:01:24.112 --> 00:01:25.112
Please!

00:01:25.432 --> 00:01:27.472
I just want to race like you guys.

00:01:27.912 --> 00:01:31.072
You will never be a racer
because you're a glitch.

00:01:31.192 --> 00:01:33.232
And that's all you'll ever be!

00:01:35.272 --> 00:01:36.912
Hey! Leave her alone!

00:01:38.312 --> 00:01:39.512
(YELLING)

00:01:39.672 --> 00:01:40.672
(SCREAMING)

00:01:40.792 --> 00:01:42.592
Let's get out of here!

00:01:47.512 --> 00:01:49.312
Scram, you rotten little cavities!

00:01:49.392 --> 00:01:50.912
Before I throw you in the mud!

00:01:57.512 --> 00:01:59.152
What are you looking at?

00:02:00.192 --> 00:02:02.672
You're welcome, you rotten little thief.

00:02:02.872 --> 00:02:06.112
I'm not a thief!
I just borrowed your stupid coin.

00:02:06.192 --> 00:02:08.872
I was going to give it back to you
as soon as I won the race.

00:02:08.952 --> 00:02:11.232
It's not a coin. It is a medal.

00:02:11.552 --> 00:02:13.312
Coin, medal, whatever.

00:02:13.392 --> 00:02:16.072
Just go back to your own dumb game
and win another one.

00:02:16.192 --> 00:02:18.552
I can't. I didn't win it in my game.

00:02:18.632 --> 00:02:20.272
I won it in Hero's Duty.

00:02:20.992 --> 00:02:22.472
Hero's Doodie?

00:02:22.712 --> 00:02:23.792
(SNIGGERS)

00:02:24.792 --> 00:02:26.512
It's not that kind of duty.

00:02:26.712 --> 00:02:28.672
I bet you really got to watch
where you step

00:02:28.752 --> 00:02:30.992
in a game called Hero's Doodie!

00:02:31.112 --> 00:02:32.352
(LAUGHING)

00:02:32.432 --> 00:02:34.672
What did you win the medal for, wiping?

00:02:36.072 --> 00:02:39.312
I hope you washed your hands
after you handled that medal.

00:02:39.552 --> 00:02:40.792
-Listen!
-One more, one more.

00:02:40.952 --> 00:02:43.312
Why did the hero flush the toilet?

00:02:44.352 --> 00:02:46.472
-Say "why."
-Why?

00:02:46.552 --> 00:02:48.632
Because it was his doodie!

00:02:48.912 --> 00:02:50.512
How dare you insult Hero's Duty?

00:02:50.592 --> 00:02:51.792
You little guttersnipe!

00:02:51.872 --> 00:02:53.352
I earned that medal

00:02:53.432 --> 00:02:55.832
and you better get it back
for me toot-sweet, sister!

00:02:55.952 --> 00:02:57.752
Well, unless you've got a go-cart

00:02:57.832 --> 00:02:59.592
hidden in the fat folds of your neck,

00:02:59.752 --> 00:03:01.072
I can't help you!

00:03:01.152 --> 00:03:02.952
(GRUNTING IN FRUSTRATION)

00:03:07.512 --> 00:03:09.192
What a moron.

00:03:09.752 --> 00:03:12.112
Hey, genius! It's a jawbreaker.

00:03:12.232 --> 00:03:13.632
You're never going to break...

00:03:15.832 --> 00:03:17.112
Huh.

00:03:17.192 --> 00:03:18.272
(PANTING)

00:03:19.192 --> 00:03:22.312
Enjoy your little tantrum, diaper baby?

00:03:22.512 --> 00:03:23.632
Leave me alone.

00:03:23.912 --> 00:03:28.032
Look, you want that medal,
right? And I want to race.

00:03:28.232 --> 00:03:29.832
So here's what I'm thinking.

00:03:30.072 --> 00:03:33.232
You help me get a new cart...
A real cart...

00:03:33.592 --> 00:03:36.312
And I'll win the race
and get you back your medal.

00:03:36.512 --> 00:03:39.072
You want me to help you?

00:03:39.192 --> 00:03:41.512
All you got to do is
break something for me.

00:03:41.672 --> 00:03:44.312
Come on. What do you say, friend?

00:03:44.712 --> 00:03:46.072
We are not friends.

00:03:46.952 --> 00:03:50.232
Oh, come on, pal. You son of a gun.

00:03:50.552 --> 00:03:52.752
Come on, buddy. Let's shake on it.

00:03:53.792 --> 00:03:55.192
Ah. Come on, chumbo.

00:03:55.312 --> 00:03:57.792
Ralph, my man. My main man.

00:03:58.432 --> 00:03:59.472
Hey!

00:03:59.872 --> 00:04:02.912
My arm's getting tired.
Do we have a deal or not?

00:04:04.152 --> 00:04:06.472
(GRUNTS) You better win.

00:04:09.472 --> 00:04:10.992
Well, I'll say this much,

00:04:11.192 --> 00:04:13.512
they don't call your friend
"Wreck-It" for nothing.

00:04:14.712 --> 00:04:16.312
There's the shuttle.

00:04:19.872 --> 00:04:20.992
Is he in there?

00:04:21.592 --> 00:04:24.072
Nope. Lucky for him.

00:04:24.152 --> 00:04:26.712
Otherwise I would have
slapped his corpse.

00:04:27.872 --> 00:04:29.352
No Cy-Bug, either.

00:04:29.872 --> 00:04:33.152
Got to find it before it lays its filthy eggs.

00:04:34.592 --> 00:04:35.792
It came this way,

00:04:35.872 --> 00:04:37.552
but the sugar particles
in the atmosphere

00:04:37.632 --> 00:04:39.112
are jamming my sensor.

00:04:39.272 --> 00:04:40.552
Can't get a read on it.

00:04:40.752 --> 00:04:43.032
So what is it with this Wreck-It joker?

00:04:43.112 --> 00:04:44.272
Why did he go AWOL?

00:04:44.352 --> 00:04:45.832
I wish I knew, ma'am.

00:04:46.072 --> 00:04:48.712
He was acting all squirrelly last night...

00:04:48.792 --> 00:04:51.432
Going on about cake and medals...

00:04:51.632 --> 00:04:54.472
But I never thought he'd go Turbo.

00:04:54.712 --> 00:04:55.832
"Go Turbo"?

00:04:56.032 --> 00:04:58.712
That's right,
you guys just got plugged in.

00:04:59.072 --> 00:05:02.232
Well, back when the arcade
first opened,

00:05:02.352 --> 00:05:05.192
Turbo Time was by far
the most popular game.

00:05:05.272 --> 00:05:07.712
-And Turbo...
-Turbo-tastic!

00:05:07.872 --> 00:05:10.472
-He loved the attention.
-Turbo-tastic!

00:05:10.552 --> 00:05:13.512
So, when RoadBlasters got plugged in

00:05:13.592 --> 00:05:15.032
and stole Turbo's thunder...

00:05:15.112 --> 00:05:16.632
New game. All right!

00:05:16.792 --> 00:05:18.632
Boy, was he jealous.

00:05:19.792 --> 00:05:23.152
So jealous that
he abandoned his game

00:05:23.232 --> 00:05:24.792
and tried to take over the new one.

00:05:24.872 --> 00:05:27.072
PLAYER 1: These are
the greatest graphics I've ever seen!

00:05:27.312 --> 00:05:28.312
Turbo-tastic!

00:05:29.312 --> 00:05:32.152
PLAYER 2: Hey. Is that...
That looks like Turbo.

00:05:33.312 --> 00:05:35.232
PLAYER 1: What's Turbo doing
in this game? Aw, come on!

00:05:35.672 --> 00:05:36.872
PLAYER 2: Mr. Litwak!

00:05:37.752 --> 00:05:41.552
FELIX: Turbo ended up
putting both games and himself

00:05:41.712 --> 00:05:44.992
out of order, for good.

00:05:45.392 --> 00:05:48.192
Yes, the selfish man
is like a mangy dog

00:05:48.272 --> 00:05:50.192
chasing a cautionary tale.

00:05:50.272 --> 00:05:51.712
I know, right?

00:05:52.392 --> 00:05:54.432
That's why I have to get Ralph home

00:05:54.512 --> 00:05:56.632
or the same thing's
gonna happen to my game.

00:05:56.712 --> 00:05:58.032
-(BLEEPING)
-Huh?

00:05:59.072 --> 00:06:00.112
(GRUNTS)

00:06:00.232 --> 00:06:01.312
(BOTH EXCLAIMING)

00:06:01.392 --> 00:06:02.752
What is this?

00:06:03.672 --> 00:06:06.272
-"Nesquik Sand"?
-Quicksand?

00:06:06.512 --> 00:06:09.192
Oh, I'll hop out
and grab you one of those vines.

00:06:09.552 --> 00:06:11.112
(GRUNTS) Huh!

00:06:11.592 --> 00:06:12.592
(GRUNTS)

00:06:13.152 --> 00:06:14.512
(GRUNTING)

00:06:14.592 --> 00:06:18.072
I can't hop. I'm hop-less.
This is hopeless!

00:06:18.152 --> 00:06:19.312
We're going to drown here.

00:06:19.392 --> 00:06:20.912
Stop thrashing. Stop moving.

00:06:20.992 --> 00:06:22.072
You're making us sink faster.

00:06:22.152 --> 00:06:23.152
We're going to die!

00:06:23.232 --> 00:06:24.752
Get ahold of yourself!

00:06:25.912 --> 00:06:27.272
(LAUGHTER)

00:06:28.872 --> 00:06:31.632
FELIX: The vines. They're Laffy Taffy.

00:06:31.792 --> 00:06:34.112
They're attracted to
whatever makes them laugh.

00:06:34.232 --> 00:06:35.672
Here, hit me again.

00:06:37.472 --> 00:06:38.592
(ALL GROAN)

00:06:39.512 --> 00:06:41.992
That's not funny enough. Harder!

00:06:42.392 --> 00:06:43.752
Look, you're a nice guy. I can't...

00:06:43.912 --> 00:06:46.512
No, ma'am!
The arcade is depending on us.

00:06:46.792 --> 00:06:49.352
Now do your duty. That's an ord...

00:06:49.632 --> 00:06:51.472
-Oh!
-(LAUGHING)

00:06:52.312 --> 00:06:53.912
It's working! Hit me again.

00:06:54.632 --> 00:06:55.832
Ooh, your eye.

00:06:56.472 --> 00:06:58.872
I can fix it. Now...

00:06:59.912 --> 00:07:02.912
Oh! San Fran-tastic! Again!

00:07:03.752 --> 00:07:05.232
Ow! You mean business!

00:07:06.552 --> 00:07:08.192
Ow! Yikes on bikes!

00:07:09.832 --> 00:07:12.992
Wow! We're... killing... them!

00:07:14.152 --> 00:07:15.432
Comedy gold!

00:07:27.352 --> 00:07:31.192
(WHIMSICAL SINGING)

00:07:41.192 --> 00:07:43.272
All right, enough with the goo-goo eyes.

00:07:43.352 --> 00:07:45.032
We've got work to do. Let's go.

00:07:46.312 --> 00:07:47.392
(BEEPING)

00:07:47.712 --> 00:07:49.392
Ugh. We lost the Cy-Bug.

00:07:49.512 --> 00:07:51.352
Come on. We'll get
a better view from the air.

00:07:51.432 --> 00:07:53.072
You think you can fix that shuttle?

00:07:53.592 --> 00:07:55.192
Can do.

